[{"ave_id":"AVE-2000-0428","file_name":"2000/AVE-2000-0428.toml","cve_id":"CVE-2000-0402","title":"Microsoft SQL Server 7.0 明文密码存储漏洞","description":"Microsoft SQL Server 7.0 的混合模式认证（Mixed Mode Authentication）功能存在敏感信息泄露漏洞。该数据库系统在日志文件中以明文形式存储系统管理员（sa）账户密码，任何具有本地系统访问权限的用户均可读取该日志文件并获取 sa 密码。攻击者利用该密码可登录 SQL Server 数据库并以最高权限执行任意 SQL 语句，甚至通过 xp_cmdshell 等扩展存储过程在服务器上执行系统命令，实现远程代码执行。该漏洞主要影响 SQL Server 7.0 版本，攻击者无需数据库认证即可通过本地文件系统访问获取高权限凭据，危害范围覆盖所有使用混合模式认证的 SQL Server 7.0 实例。Microsoft 已在后续 Service Pack 中修复此安全缺陷，建议用户升级至 SQL Server 7.0 SP3 或更高版本。","severity":"LOW","score":2.1,"aliases":["CVE-2000-0402"],"sources":["avd"],"published":"2000-05-30T04:00:00Z","updated":"2026-06-16T21:51:38Z","remediation":"立即安装 Microsoft SQL Server 7.0 Service Pack 2 或更高版本，该补丁已修复 sa 密码明文记录问题。如无法升级，建议将认证模式从 Mixed Mode 切换为 Windows 身份验证模式，并限制对 SQL Server 日志文件（ERRORLOG 等）的访问权限，仅允许管理员账户读取。","status":"completed","collected_at":"2026-07-23T00:00:00Z","references":["http://www.microsoft.com/technet/support/kb.asp?ID=263968","http://www.securityfocus.com/bid/1281","https://docs.microsoft.com/en-us/security-updates/securitybulletins/2000/ms00-035","https://github.com/CVEProject/cvelistV5/blob/7a274ec07043f54c07d0a3b5c7fc89ba5793f023/cves/2000/0xxx/CVE-2000-0402.json","https://github.com/LiuCan01/cve-list-pro/blob/78b55511cee3604c22d518e32822f0435d0cacc0/cve-list/CVE-2000/CVE-2000-0402","https://github.com/e-m-b-a/emba/blob/4d0f24b3edae0bdb5391177851bad3be54ecea0f/config/msf_cve-db.txt","https://github.com/yarencheng/cve-devops-playground/blob/cbe73d6bdcced13ea57f08566d6bbf5345864f7e/content/CVE-2000-0402.md","https://github.com/Patrowl/PatrowlHearsData/blob/1decc7ade63192f9f527bfb87145d1636c01cc59/CVE/data/2000/CVE-2000-0402.json","https://github.com/dependency-check/DependencyCheck/blob/7dcfc0737c21744b423c2198ae979003c2eb67e2/core/src/main/resources/dependencycheck-base-suppression.xml","https://github.com/wick2o/osf_db/blob/5ff9e4fe46911948aa9cbb9aa2416b4ad7cc2e2b/exploits/5411_0.nasl","https://github.com/Chudry/Xerror/blob/07ec57cabcd27cdb47c89af452bdf4ed07207347/xerror/parsing/msf_module_result/msf_module_cve.txt","https://github.com/marcellodesales/aibbp-reverse-engineer/blob/960f610d597aae9fec1cc5f03c68679be00c222d/reverse_engineer/acunetix/vulnerabilities/vdb/2000/0xxx/cve-2000-0402.yaml","https://github.com/kylekirkby/Python-Exploit-Search-Tool/blob/8e84b77a6ff689ce32d04884f9ea75de04ae0433/platforms/windows/remote/21693.nasl"],"poc_urls":[],"exp_urls":[],"repo_poc_urls":[],"repo_exp_urls":[],"has_poc":false,"has_exp":false,"raw_url":"https://github.com/adysec/AVE/blob/main/vulns/2000/AVE-2000-0428.toml"},{"ave_id":"AVE-2000-0418","file_name":"2000/AVE-2000-0418.toml","cve_id":"CVE-2000-0495","title":"Microsoft Windows Media Services 拒绝服务漏洞","description":"Microsoft Windows Media Services 4.0/4.1 的 Windows Media Encoder 组件存在拒绝服务漏洞（MS00-038），远程未认证攻击者可通过发送畸形编码器请求触发该漏洞，导致服务拒绝服务。该漏洞影响 Windows Media Services 4.0 和 4.1 版本，CVSS 评分 5.0（AV:N/AC:L/Au:N/C:N/I:N/A:P），攻击复杂度低、无需认证、仅影响可用性。攻击者只需向目标服务器发送特制的畸形编码器请求即可触发拒绝服务，导致服务停止响应。Microsoft 已发布安全公告 MS00-038 修复此漏洞，建议升级至修复版本或应用补丁。ExploitDB 已公开 PoC 代码（EDB-ID: 19974）。","severity":"MEDIUM","score":5.0,"aliases":["CVE-2000-0495"],"sources":["avd"],"published":"2000-05-30T04:00:00Z","updated":"2026-06-16T21:51:51Z","remediation":"立即安装微软安全公告 MS00-038 提供的安全补丁（针对 Windows Media Services 4.0/4.1），或直接升级到 Windows Media Services 9.0 及以上版本。如暂时无法打补丁，请在防火墙层面禁止 1755 端口（MMS 协议默认端口）的外部访问，并在 IIS 中禁用 Windows Media 相关 ISAPI 扩展作为临时缓解措施。建议尽快升级至 Windows Media Services 9.0 系列以彻底修复该拒绝服务漏洞。","status":"completed","collected_at":"2026-07-25T00:00:00Z","references":["http://www.securityfocus.com/bid/1282","https://docs.microsoft.com/en-us/security-updates/securitybulletins/2000/ms00-038","https://exchange.xforce.ibmcloud.com/vulnerabilities/4585","https://www.exploit-db.com/exploits/19974","https://github.com/CVEProject/cvelistV5/blob/e0d4b639863e3178ba8dc8b525356f8aab24b9da/cves/2000/0xxx/CVE-2000-0495.json","https://github.com/LiuCan01/cve-list-pro/blob/78b55511cee3604c22d518e32822f0435d0cacc0/cve-list/CVE-2000/CVE-2000-0495","https://github.com/HORKimhab/poc-cve-collection/blob/7679da85bd348992f49e2c46d2198526392248ee/2000/0xxx/CVE-2000-0495.md","https://github.com/Patrowl/PatrowlHearsData/blob/eba749de89f8c70fe7dc7fa1f83de98dd5147c06/CVE/data/2000/CVE-2000-0495.json","https://github.com/github/advisory-database/blob/fb70ff2c257f1ca47c72f5b8b5d913d0de6cca53/advisories/unreviewed/2022/04/GHSA-jrv6-w97f-q9vv/GHSA-jrv6-w97f-q9vv.json","https://github.com/intSpLoiT/intframework/blob/eabaa799d0260aa52b735fa9769266d1ce4b64ef/modules/cve_list.txt","https://github.com/nomi-sec/NVD-Database/blob/23dc120c34402aaa65883c51c1d03b3cb02c20cb/2000/CVE-2000-0495.json","https://github.com/KTZgraph/sarenka/blob/f1fb931ab722d6c096d581ed6e3c5966d799fbaa/sarenka/feeds/cve_details/cve_all_details_152400_152500.json","https://github.com/andreafioraldi/ToolsForCyberChallenge/blob/197d3dfd204cf1b9d1af1451455c8831c3ff9948/generated/files_1.list.dict","https://github.com/oasis-open/cti-stix-common-objects/blob/55ba7598cbd5a52577b6887871505d931d85cb61/objects/vulnerability/vulnerability--b4da0b8e-6f0a-4a39-bb10-1561970f2401.json"],"poc_urls":[],"exp_urls":[],"repo_poc_urls":["https://raw.githubusercontent.com/adysec/AVE/main/pocs/2000/POC-AVE-2000-0418.toml"],"repo_exp_urls":[],"has_poc":true,"has_exp":false,"raw_url":"https://github.com/adysec/AVE/blob/main/vulns/2000/AVE-2000-0418.toml"},{"ave_id":"AVE-2000-0656","file_name":"2000/AVE-2000-0656.toml","cve_id":"CVE-2000-0564","title":"Mirabilis ICQ Web Front 服务 Guestbook CGI 长 URL 参数拒绝服务漏洞","description":"Mirabilis ICQ Web Front 服务中的 Guestbook CGI 程序存在输入验证缺陷，远程攻击者无需身份认证即可通过向 guestbook 参数提交超长 URL 名称触发缓冲区异常，导致 ICQ Web Front 服务进程崩溃，造成拒绝服务。该漏洞影响 ICQ 2000a、99b 及更早版本，攻击复杂度低，仅需构造特制 HTTP 请求即可利用，无需用户交互。","severity":"MEDIUM","score":5.0,"aliases":["CVE-2000-0564"],"sources":["avd"],"published":"2000-05-29T04:00:00Z","updated":"2026-06-16T21:52:00Z","remediation":"该漏洞影响 Mirabilis ICQ 2000a/99b 及更早版本的 Web Front 服务 guestbook CGI 组件。由于该产品已停止维护且无官方补丁，建议立即停用 ICQ Web Front 服务或将其从公网隔离；如必须使用，可在 Web 服务器或应用层对 guestbook CGI 的 name 参数做长度限制（如限制不超过 256 字符），并部署 WAF 规则拦截超长 URL 请求。","status":"completed","collected_at":"2026-07-27T00:00:00Z","references":["http://archives.neohapsis.com/archives/ntbugtraq/2000-q2/0218.html","https://github.com/trickest/cve/blob/e69d88e0152845fc4d4b49970ca6e503f56b2f93/2000/CVE-2000-0564.md","https://github.com/CVEProject/cvelistV5/blob/d426ca16061eaa1a65a39ea953ac0efe02aa4cae/cves/2000/0xxx/CVE-2000-0564.json","https://github.com/LiuCan01/cve-list-pro/blob/78b55511cee3604c22d518e32822f0435d0cacc0/cve-list/CVE-2000/CVE-2000-0564","https://github.com/edoardottt/missing-cve-nuclei-templates/blob/b93b72c800b93d13fcc97984485ecaf9a9b5cbc1/data/year/2000.txt","https://github.com/Patrowl/PatrowlHearsData/blob/db2f5eda64b048f89c93b57f05c779b62a05c5c9/CVE/data/2000/CVE-2000-0564.json","https://github.com/mabitoski/cve_submodules/blob/44ad7e2705b3aef1b2ffaf64bd47596c10a6c2e4/2000/CVE-2000-0564.md","https://github.com/rhuitl/uClinux/blob/0486e80a025dccbe4a2213715a2ab8a5063ea86b/user/nessus/nessus-plugins/scripts/icq_vulns.nasl","https://github.com/github/advisory-database/blob/29919db3f954d9ce9be0e7e3cf177436392d45d3/advisories/unreviewed/2022/04/GHSA-rxr9-jwx6-w6jq/GHSA-rxr9-jwx6-w6jq.json","https://github.com/intSpLoiT/intframework/blob/eabaa799d0260aa52b735fa9769266d1ce4b64ef/modules/cve_list.txt","https://github.com/nomi-sec/NVD-Database/blob/23dc120c34402aaa65883c51c1d03b3cb02c20cb/2000/CVE-2000-0564.json"],"poc_urls":[],"exp_urls":[],"repo_poc_urls":[],"repo_exp_urls":[],"has_poc":false,"has_exp":false,"raw_url":"https://github.com/adysec/AVE/blob/main/vulns/2000/AVE-2000-0656.toml"},{"ave_id":"AVE-2000-0514","file_name":"2000/AVE-2000-0514.toml","cve_id":"CVE-2000-0461","title":"NetBSD semconfig 系统调用拒绝服务漏洞","description":"NetBSD 及 BSD 衍生系统中存在未文档化的 semconfig 系统调用漏洞，该调用会冻结信号量的状态，导致本地用户可通过调用 semconfig 系统调用使信号量系统陷入拒绝服务状态。该漏洞影响 NetBSD 及相关 BSD 衍生系统，CVSS 评分 2.1（AV:L/AC:L/Au:N/C:N/I:N/A:P），属于本地拒绝服务漏洞，攻击者需具备本地用户权限且能调用 semconfig 系统调用即可触发，利用方式为直接调用该未文档化系统调用冻结信号量状态导致系统信号量机制失效，造成拒绝服务影响。","severity":"LOW","score":2.1,"aliases":["CVE-2000-0461"],"sources":["avd"],"published":"2000-05-29T04:00:00Z","updated":"2026-06-16T21:51:47Z","remediation":"建议立即升级至 NetBSD 9.3 或 10.0 及以上版本（该版本已移除/修复未文档化的 semconfig 系统调用）。若无法立即升级，可编译内核时排除 semconfig 系统调用（在内核配置文件中移除 semconfig 支持），或通过文件系统权限限制本地用户访问 /dev/ksyms 等接口作为临时缓解措施。同时建议限制本地用户权限，避免非必要用户获取 shell 访问权限。","status":"completed","collected_at":"2026-07-24T00:00:00Z","references":["http://www.openbsd.org/errata26.html#semconfig","http://www.securityfocus.com/bid/1270","https://github.com/trickest/cve/blob/efd7fc726910da5a47b5ea864d60bf92f66b594e/2000/CVE-2000-0461.md","https://github.com/CVEProject/cvelistV5/blob/67d48875bcd35ab339290b9a99c435b09bd5c40b/cves/2000/0xxx/CVE-2000-0461.json","https://github.com/LiuCan01/cve-list-pro/blob/78b55511cee3604c22d518e32822f0435d0cacc0/cve-list/CVE-2000/CVE-2000-0461","https://github.com/edoardottt/missing-cve-nuclei-templates/blob/115c94bd1da3cc18977d652d6e78c9f4a5dfc13b/data/year/2000.txt","https://github.com/Patrowl/PatrowlHearsData/blob/c52ac29e3e33d673083c7aada18d2fe25f185ca8/CVE/data/2000/CVE-2000-0461.json","https://github.com/mabitoski/cve_submodules/blob/44ad7e2705b3aef1b2ffaf64bd47596c10a6c2e4/2000/CVE-2000-0461.md","https://github.com/github/advisory-database/blob/2b8a7bdd977d852aa4b7aade01f4fcd4d623cfde/advisories/unreviewed/2022/05/GHSA-3rxh-gp2j-2w4m/GHSA-3rxh-gp2j-2w4m.json","https://github.com/intSpLoiT/intframework/blob/eabaa799d0260aa52b735fa9769266d1ce4b64ef/modules/cve_list.txt","https://github.com/KTZgraph/sarenka/blob/f1fb931ab722d6c096d581ed6e3c5966d799fbaa/sarenka/feeds/cve_details/cve_all_details_152400_152500.json","https://github.com/oasis-open/cti-stix-common-objects/blob/55ba7598cbd5a52577b6887871505d931d85cb61/objects/vulnerability/vulnerability--c2e7ec15-6d13-4232-b36f-4ee9b37ad606.json"],"poc_urls":[],"exp_urls":[],"repo_poc_urls":[],"repo_exp_urls":[],"has_poc":false,"has_exp":false,"raw_url":"https://github.com/adysec/AVE/blob/main/vulns/2000/AVE-2000-0514.toml"},{"ave_id":"AVE-2000-0502","file_name":"2000/AVE-2000-0502.toml","cve_id":"CVE-2000-0455","title":"xlockmore xlock 本地缓冲区溢出漏洞","description":"xlock程序存在缓冲区溢出漏洞，该漏洞影响xlockmore xlock程序4.16及更早版本。当本地用户向程序输入过长的-mode选项参数时，会触发缓冲区溢出，导致程序试图读取超出安全边界的内存区域。此漏洞允许攻击者通过精心构造的恶意输入来读取系统内存中的敏感数据，如密码、密钥或配置文件信息。攻击者无需任何权限即可利用此漏洞进行攻击，利用过程相对简单，只需向目标程序传递包含过多字符的-mode参数即可。此外，由于漏洞位于本地权限级别，攻击者通常需要首先获得目标系统的本地访问权限。","severity":"LOW","score":2.1,"aliases":["CVE-2000-0455"],"sources":["avd"],"published":"2000-05-29T04:00:00Z","updated":"2026-06-16T21:51:46Z","remediation":"建议立即升级 xlockmore 到 4.17 或更高版本（修复了 -mode 参数缓冲区溢出）。若无法立即升级，可卸载 xlock 或移除其 setuid 位（chmod u-s /usr/bin/xlock），改用 xscreensaver 等替代屏幕锁定程序作为缓解措施。","status":"completed","collected_at":"2026-07-24T00:00:00Z","references":["http://archives.neohapsis.com/archives/bugtraq/2000-05/0375.html","http://www.nai.com/nai_labs/asp_set/advisory/41initialized.asp","http://www.securityfocus.com/bid/1267","https://github.com/trickest/cve/blob/efd7fc726910da5a47b5ea864d60bf92f66b594e/2000/CVE-2000-0455.md","https://github.com/CVEProject/cvelistV5/blob/67d48875bcd35ab339290b9a99c435b09bd5c40b/cves/2000/0xxx/CVE-2000-0455.json","https://github.com/LiuCan01/cve-list-pro/blob/78b55511cee3604c22d518e32822f0435d0cacc0/cve-list/CVE-2000/CVE-2000-0455","https://github.com/Patrowl/PatrowlHearsData/blob/dc46d37c28bb275abd05bf31414b33cf4107e07c/CVE/data/2000/CVE-2000-0455.json","https://github.com/mabitoski/cve_submodules/blob/44ad7e2705b3aef1b2ffaf64bd47596c10a6c2e4/2000/CVE-2000-0455.md","https://github.com/github/advisory-database/blob/2b8a7bdd977d852aa4b7aade01f4fcd4d623cfde/advisories/unreviewed/2022/05/GHSA-4r8f-7gpj-fr4c/GHSA-4r8f-7gpj-fr4c.json","https://github.com/intSpLoiT/intframework/blob/eabaa799d0260aa52b735fa9769266d1ce4b64ef/modules/cve_list.txt","https://github.com/nomi-sec/NVD-Database/blob/23dc120c34402aaa65883c51c1d03b3cb02c20cb/2000/CVE-2000-0455.json","https://github.com/HORKimhab/poc-cve-collection/blob/f7d503345a02e01eaaf915c0e3939c46f947a88c/2000/0xxx/CVE-2000-0455.md","https://github.com/leego972/titanai/blob/afa5b2310463aae5781d3fd9408071bf38e79806/data/raw/corpus_D_cyber/nvd_cve_001420.txt"],"poc_urls":[],"exp_urls":[],"repo_poc_urls":[],"repo_exp_urls":[],"has_poc":false,"has_exp":false,"raw_url":"https://github.com/adysec/AVE/blob/main/vulns/2000/AVE-2000-0502.toml"},{"ave_id":"AVE-2000-0378","file_name":"2000/AVE-2000-0378.toml","cve_id":"CVE-2000-0454","title":"Mandriva Linux Mandrake 7.0 cdrecord 本地缓冲区溢出漏洞","description":"Mandriva Linux Mandrake 7.0 中 cdrecord 工具存在缓冲区溢出漏洞，本地攻击者可通过构造恶意的 dev 参数触发栈缓冲区溢出，进而实现本地权限提升至 root 权限。该漏洞源于 cdrecord 在处理 dev 参数时未进行边界检查，攻击者仅需本地普通用户权限即可构造超长参数覆盖返回地址并执行任意代码。受影响版本为 Mandriva Linux Mandrake 7.0 默认安装的 cdrecord 版本，CVSS 评分 7.2（本地攻击、低复杂度、无需认证、完全影响 CIA），属于高危本地提权漏洞。攻击者仅需本地账户即可利用该漏洞获取 root 权限，建议升级至修复版本或限制 cdrecord 的 SUID 权限。","severity":"HIGH","score":7.2,"aliases":["CVE-2000-0454"],"sources":["avd"],"published":"2000-05-29T04:00:00Z","updated":"2026-06-16T21:51:46Z","remediation":"升级 cdrecord 到最新 patched 版本（≥3.2），或直接迁移到现代的 growisofs 或 wodim 等替代 burning 工具；同时修改配置文件，严格验证 dev 参数长度和字符集，避免包含 '..' 或特殊字符；如果无法立即更新，可临时通过修改 /etc/group 文件将 cdrecord 用户从 root 分组中移除，或在 sudoers 文件中限制 cdrecord 的权限。这样可以直接修复已知溢出漏洞，通过输入验证和权限控制提供即时缓解措施。","status":"completed","collected_at":"2026-07-24T00:00:00Z","references":["http://archives.neohapsis.com/archives/bugtraq/2000-05/0367.html","http://archives.neohapsis.com/archives/bugtraq/2000-05/0434.html","http://archives.neohapsis.com/archives/bugtraq/2000-06/0019.html","http://www.securityfocus.com/bid/1265","https://www.exploit-db.com/exploits/19969","https://github.com/CVEProject/cvelistV5/blob/67d48875bcd35ab339290b9a99c435b09bd5c40b/cves/2000/0xxx/CVE-2000-0454.json","https://github.com/LiuCan01/cve-list-pro/blob/78b55511cee3604c22d518e32822f0435d0cacc0/cve-list/CVE-2000/CVE-2000-0454","https://github.com/HORKimhab/poc-cve-collection/blob/f7d503345a02e01eaaf915c0e3939c46f947a88c/2000/0xxx/CVE-2000-0454.md","https://github.com/Patrowl/PatrowlHearsData/blob/dc46d37c28bb275abd05bf31414b33cf4107e07c/CVE/data/2000/CVE-2000-0454.json","https://github.com/github/advisory-database/blob/2b8a7bdd977d852aa4b7aade01f4fcd4d623cfde/advisories/unreviewed/2022/04/GHSA-cr5m-c8fx-9pvc/GHSA-cr5m-c8fx-9pvc.json","https://github.com/intSpLoiT/intframework/blob/eabaa799d0260aa52b735fa9769266d1ce4b64ef/modules/cve_list.txt","https://github.com/nomi-sec/NVD-Database/blob/23dc120c34402aaa65883c51c1d03b3cb02c20cb/2000/CVE-2000-0454.json","https://github.com/KTZgraph/sarenka/blob/f1fb931ab722d6c096d581ed6e3c5966d799fbaa/sarenka/feeds/cve_details/cve_all_details_152400_152500.json","https://github.com/andreafioraldi/ToolsForCyberChallenge/blob/197d3dfd204cf1b9d1af1451455c8831c3ff9948/generated/files_0.list.dict","https://github.com/oasis-open/cti-stix-common-objects/blob/55ba7598cbd5a52577b6887871505d931d85cb61/objects/vulnerability/vulnerability--d80adab4-d3f9-4600-8008-5dbce5633f21.json"],"poc_urls":[],"exp_urls":[],"repo_poc_urls":["https://raw.githubusercontent.com/adysec/AVE/main/pocs/2000/POC-AVE-2000-0378.toml"],"repo_exp_urls":[],"has_poc":true,"has_exp":false,"raw_url":"https://github.com/adysec/AVE/blob/main/vulns/2000/AVE-2000-0378.toml"},{"ave_id":"AVE-2000-0504","file_name":"2000/AVE-2000-0504.toml","cve_id":"CVE-2000-0456","title":"NetBSD项目组 NetBSD 1.4.2 CPU耗尽拒绝服务漏洞","description":"NetBSD 1.4.2 及更早版本内核中某些系统调用未正确释放 CPU 时间片，本地用户可通过反复调用这些不释放 CPU 的系统调用（称为 \"cpu-hog\"），独占 CPU 资源导致系统拒绝服务。该漏洞影响 NetBSD 1.4.2 及更早版本，CVSS 评分 2.1（本地访问/低复杂度/无需认证/仅影响可用性），攻击者需具备本地账户权限，通过反复调用特定不释放 CPU 的系统调用独占处理器资源，导致系统无响应或崩溃，造成拒绝服务。","severity":"LOW","score":2.1,"aliases":["CVE-2000-0456"],"sources":["avd"],"published":"2000-05-28T04:00:00Z","updated":"2026-06-16T21:51:46Z","remediation":"升级 NetBSD 至 1.4.3 或更高版本（已修复该内核 CPU 占用漏洞）。若无法立即升级，可通过内核参数限制单进程 CPU 时间（如设置 kern.maxprocperuid 限制用户进程数），或使用资源限制（ulimit -t）限制单进程 CPU 时间作为临时缓解措施。","status":"completed","collected_at":"2026-07-24T00:00:00Z","references":["http://www.osvdb.org/1365","http://www.securityfocus.com/bid/1272","https://github.com/CVEProject/cvelistV5/blob/67d48875bcd35ab339290b9a99c435b09bd5c40b/cves/2000/0xxx/CVE-2000-0456.json","https://github.com/LiuCan01/cve-list-pro/blob/78b55511cee3604c22d518e32822f0435d0cacc0/cve-list/CVE-2000/CVE-2000-0456","https://github.com/HORKimhab/poc-cve-collection/blob/f7d503345a02e01eaaf915c0e3939c46f947a88c/2000/0xxx/CVE-2000-0456.md","https://github.com/Patrowl/PatrowlHearsData/blob/dc46d37c28bb275abd05bf31414b33cf4107e07c/CVE/data/2000/CVE-2000-0456.json","https://github.com/github/advisory-database/blob/2b8a7bdd977d852aa4b7aade01f4fcd4d623cfde/advisories/unreviewed/2022/05/GHSA-2c6h-prr7-885p/GHSA-2c6h-prr7-885p.json","https://github.com/yarencheng/cve-devops-playground/blob/4731f60845c8f35e2bdb03d333a9e9d84c7b1c27/content/CVE-2000-0456.md","https://github.com/intSpLoiT/intframework/blob/eabaa799d0260aa52b735fa9769266d1ce4b64ef/modules/cve_list.txt","https://github.com/nomi-sec/NVD-Database/blob/23dc120c34402aaa65883c51c1d03b3cb02c20cb/2000/CVE-2000-0456.json","https://github.com/oasis-open/cti-stix-common-objects/blob/55ba7598cbd5a52577b6887871505d931d85cb61/objects/vulnerability/vulnerability--059bd44a-700b-416a-a033-6ffc4239a7fe.json","https://github.com/leego972/titanai/blob/afa5b2310463aae5781d3fd9408071bf38e79806/data/raw/corpus_D_cyber/nvd_cve_001418.txt"],"poc_urls":[],"exp_urls":[],"repo_poc_urls":[],"repo_exp_urls":[],"has_poc":false,"has_exp":false,"raw_url":"https://github.com/adysec/AVE/blob/main/vulns/2000/AVE-2000-0504.toml"},{"ave_id":"AVE-2000-0516","file_name":"2000/AVE-2000-0516.toml","cve_id":"CVE-2000-0462","title":"NetBSD ftpchroot 分析漏洞","description":"NetBSD ftpd 的 ftpchroot 功能存在路径解析漏洞，攻击者可通过构造包含 \"..\" 路径遍历序列的 FTP 命令（如 CWD、RETR 等），绕过 chroot 限制跳出受限目录，读取或写入服务器文件系统任意位置的文件。影响 NetBSD 1.4.x 及更早版本的 ftpd 服务，攻击者需拥有合法 FTP 账号并具备登录权限，通过发送精心构造的路径遍历序列即可突破 chroot 限制，导致敏感文件泄露或任意文件写入，进而可能进一步提权控制服务器。NetBSD 官方已发布补丁修复该路径解析缺陷。","severity":"MEDIUM","score":5.0,"aliases":["CVE-2000-0462"],"sources":["avd"],"published":"2000-05-28T00:00:00Z","updated":"2000-05-28T00:00:00Z","remediation":"建议升级 NetBSD 至 1.5 及以上版本，或应用 NetBSD 官方发布的 ftpchroot 补丁（ftp://ftp.netbsd.org/pub/NetBSD/misc/security/advisories/NetBSD-SA2000-012.txt.asc）。若无法立即升级，可临时禁用 ftpchroot 功能或限制 FTP 服务仅允许受信 IP 访问。","status":"completed","collected_at":"2026-07-24T00:00:00Z","references":["https://github.com/CVEProject/cvelistV5/blob/67d48875bcd35ab339290b9a99c435b09bd5c40b/cves/2000/0xxx/CVE-2000-0462.json","https://github.com/LiuCan01/cve-list-pro/blob/78b55511cee3604c22d518e32822f0435d0cacc0/cve-list/CVE-2000/CVE-2000-0462","https://github.com/HORKimhab/poc-cve-collection/blob/f7d503345a02e01eaaf915c0e3939c46f947a88c/2000/0xxx/CVE-2000-0462.md","https://github.com/Patrowl/PatrowlHearsData/blob/c52ac29e3e33d673083c7aada18d2fe25f185ca8/CVE/data/2000/CVE-2000-0462.json","https://github.com/github/advisory-database/blob/2b8a7bdd977d852aa4b7aade01f4fcd4d623cfde/advisories/unreviewed/2022/05/GHSA-q428-rghj-777v/GHSA-q428-rghj-777v.json","https://github.com/yarencheng/cve-devops-playground/blob/4731f60845c8f35e2bdb03d333a9e9d84c7b1c27/content/CVE-2000-0462.md","https://github.com/intSpLoiT/intframework/blob/eabaa799d0260aa52b735fa9769266d1ce4b64ef/modules/cve_list.txt","https://github.com/KTZgraph/sarenka/blob/f1fb931ab722d6c096d581ed6e3c5966d799fbaa/sarenka/feeds/cve_details/cve_all_details_152400_152500.json","https://github.com/olbat/nvdcve/blob/a036095fb2c093f3863681adc5999690c37b930e/nvdcve/CVE-2000-0462.json","https://github.com/oasis-open/cti-stix-common-objects/blob/55ba7598cbd5a52577b6887871505d931d85cb61/objects/vulnerability/vulnerability--a083d977-81b4-482d-b781-4a5a5f4218fd.json"],"poc_urls":[],"exp_urls":[],"repo_poc_urls":[],"repo_exp_urls":[],"has_poc":false,"has_exp":false,"raw_url":"https://github.com/adysec/AVE/blob/main/vulns/2000/AVE-2000-0516.toml"},{"ave_id":"AVE-2000-0382","file_name":"2000/AVE-2000-0382.toml","cve_id":"CVE-2000-0460","title":"KDE kdesud DISPLAY环境变量缓冲区溢出漏洞","description":"该漏洞存在于KDE 1.1及其派生版本（1.1.1/1.1.2/1.2）中的kdesud程序中，由于对DISPLAY环境变量的处理不当，导致发生缓冲区溢出。攻击者通过设置过长的DISPLAY环境变量，破坏程序正常堆栈结构，可能劫持控制权并执行任意代码。该漏洞仅需本地权限即可触发，但其影响非常严重，能够完全破坏目标系统的保密性、完整性和可用性，允许攻击者获得root权限并完全掌控受损主机。该漏洞影响各个Linux发行中安装了KDE桌面环境的系统，尤其是在使用较旧的KDE 1.x系列时风险更高。攻击者可通过编写恶意shell脚本或通过图形登录界面触发此漏洞，实现系统权限提升并完全控制目标主机。微软KDE团队已发布安全补丁，用户应及时升级至支持的安全版本以修复此漏洞。","severity":"HIGH","score":7.2,"aliases":["CVE-2000-0460"],"sources":["avd"],"published":"2000-05-27T04:00:00Z","updated":"2026-06-16T21:51:46Z","remediation":"建议升级 KDE 至 2.0.1 或更高版本（该版本已修复 kdesud DISPLAY 环境变量缓冲区溢出漏洞），或升级至 KDE 2.1.1 及以上稳定版本。若无法立即升级，可通过限制 DISPLAY 环境变量长度（如 export DISPLAY=:0.0）或在不需要 kdesud 服务时卸载/禁用 kdesud 服务作为临时缓解措施。","status":"completed","collected_at":"2026-07-24T00:00:00Z","references":["http://archives.neohapsis.com/archives/bugtraq/2000-05/0353.html","http://www.securityfocus.com/bid/1274","https://www.exploit-db.com/exploits/19970","https://github.com/CVEProject/cvelistV5/blob/67d48875bcd35ab339290b9a99c435b09bd5c40b/cves/2000/0xxx/CVE-2000-0460.json","https://github.com/LiuCan01/cve-list-pro/blob/78b55511cee3604c22d518e32822f0435d0cacc0/cve-list/CVE-2000/CVE-2000-0460","https://github.com/HORKimhab/poc-cve-collection/blob/f7d503345a02e01eaaf915c0e3939c46f947a88c/2000/0xxx/CVE-2000-0460.md","https://github.com/Patrowl/PatrowlHearsData/blob/c52ac29e3e33d673083c7aada18d2fe25f185ca8/CVE/data/2000/CVE-2000-0460.json","https://github.com/github/advisory-database/blob/2b8a7bdd977d852aa4b7aade01f4fcd4d623cfde/advisories/unreviewed/2022/04/GHSA-3j2h-fq3g-cjhp/GHSA-3j2h-fq3g-cjhp.json","https://github.com/yarencheng/cve-devops-playground/blob/4731f60845c8f35e2bdb03d333a9e9d84c7b1c27/content/CVE-2000-0460.md","https://github.com/intSpLoiT/intframework/blob/eabaa799d0260aa52b735fa9769266d1ce4b64ef/modules/cve_list.txt","https://github.com/KTZgraph/sarenka/blob/f1fb931ab722d6c096d581ed6e3c5966d799fbaa/sarenka/feeds/cve_details/cve_all_details_152400_152500.json","https://github.com/olbat/nvdcve/blob/a036095fb2c093f3863681adc5999690c37b930e/nvdcve/CVE-2000-0460.json","https://github.com/nomi-sec/NVD-Exploit-List-Ja/blob/b82432e7d59d95db9f183c0cefa7744595784afa/2000.tsv"],"poc_urls":[],"exp_urls":[],"repo_poc_urls":["https://raw.githubusercontent.com/adysec/AVE/main/pocs/2000/POC-AVE-2000-0382.toml"],"repo_exp_urls":["https://raw.githubusercontent.com/adysec/AVE/main/exploits/2000/EXP-AVE-2000-0382.toml"],"has_poc":true,"has_exp":true,"raw_url":"https://github.com/adysec/AVE/blob/main/vulns/2000/AVE-2000-0382.toml"},{"ave_id":"AVE-2000-0640","file_name":"2000/AVE-2000-0640.toml","cve_id":"CVE-2000-0553","title":"IPFilter 防火墙 竞态条件安全绕过漏洞","description":"IPFilter 防火墙（3.4.3 及更早版本）存在竞争条件漏洞，当管理员配置了重叠的 \"return-rst\"（返回RST复位包）与 \"keep state\"（保持连接状态）规则时，两种规则在状态维护逻辑上产生冲突。远程攻击者可利用该竞争条件，在防火墙规则处理的竞态窗口期间绕过访问控制限制，实现对受保护资源的未授权访问。攻击者无需认证，仅需从网络侧向目标系统发起特定连接请求即可触发该漏洞，CVSS 评分 2.6（低危），主要影响系统完整性。该漏洞已于 2000 年公开披露，建议用户升级至修复后的 IPFilter 版本或调整防火墙规则以避免重叠配置。","severity":"LOW","score":2.6,"aliases":["CVE-2000-0553"],"sources":["avd"],"published":"2000-05-26T04:00:00Z","updated":"2026-06-16T21:51:59Z","remediation":"立即升级 IPFilter 至 3.4.4 或更高版本（最终版 5.1.2），从 https://www.phil.uu/~ipfilter/ 下载源码编译安装。若无法立即升级，应在防火墙规则中避免同时使用 \"return-rst\" 与 \"keep state\" 重叠规则——将两者拆分为独立规则链或重新排列规则顺序使其不产生状态竞争。对于仍在运行旧版 IPFilter 的系统，建议迁移到 pf（OpenBSD Packet Filter）作为替代方案，pf 在主流 BSD 系统中已默认集成且不存在此竞争条件。","status":"completed","collected_at":"2026-07-27T00:00:00Z","references":["http://archives.neohapsis.com/archives/bugtraq/2000-05/0326.html","http://www.osvdb.org/1377","http://www.securityfocus.com/bid/1308","https://exchange.xforce.ibmcloud.com/vulnerabilities/4994","https://github.com/CVEProject/cvelistV5/blob/15ba52d0829fe2220e9f89276b2743c7eef0ab2a/cves/2000/0xxx/CVE-2000-0553.json","https://github.com/LiuCan01/cve-list-pro/blob/78b55511cee3604c22d518e32822f0435d0cacc0/cve-list/CVE-2000/CVE-2000-0553","https://github.com/HORKimhab/poc-cve-collection/blob/291c09f8f1fb3b2fa866c7b93e7660471419cef8/2000/0xxx/CVE-2000-0553.md","https://github.com/Patrowl/PatrowlHearsData/blob/6cdd862a65f157a01ff9fd42e651329142c691d2/CVE/data/2000/CVE-2000-0553.json","https://github.com/github/advisory-database/blob/fa1c2f93b0d15da115c038738e571c1a1553b4cc/advisories/unreviewed/2022/04/GHSA-wmhx-3hr4-6h39/GHSA-wmhx-3hr4-6h39.json","https://github.com/yarencheng/cve-devops-playground/blob/c54e59752dddfc9aa36c13774164384cfa0d1f04/content/CVE-2000-0553.md","https://github.com/nomi-sec/NVD-Database/blob/23dc120c34402aaa65883c51c1d03b3cb02c20cb/2000/CVE-2000-0553.json","https://github.com/KTZgraph/sarenka/blob/f1fb931ab722d6c096d581ed6e3c5966d799fbaa/sarenka/feeds/cve_details/cve_all_details_152400_152500.json","https://github.com/oasis-open/cti-stix-common-objects/blob/55ba7598cbd5a52577b6887871505d931d85cb61/objects/vulnerability/vulnerability--718f94a7-117e-46f2-bb67-5bb05cc3b125.json","https://github.com/Yuning-J/NVDFeatureAnalysis/blob/493a57a415cc110f9945148abd717eeb92f6ca7e/originalDataset/cveIDThreatType/cve_idbypass"],"poc_urls":[],"exp_urls":[],"repo_poc_urls":[],"repo_exp_urls":[],"has_poc":false,"has_exp":false,"raw_url":"https://github.com/adysec/AVE/blob/main/vulns/2000/AVE-2000-0640.toml"},{"ave_id":"AVE-2000-0584","file_name":"2000/AVE-2000-0584.toml","cve_id":"CVE-2000-0517","title":"Netscape Communicator 证书验证欺骗漏洞","description":"Netscape Communicator 4.73 及之前版本存在证书验证欺骗漏洞。如果用户此前已接受某个网站的证书，当该网站的 DNS 信息被攻击者篡改后，攻击者可将流量重定向至恶意服务器，而浏览器不会对无效证书发出警告，从而绕过证书信任机制实现网站身份欺骗。攻击者需具备 DNS 投毒或域名劫持能力，利用受害用户已建立的证书信任关系实施欺骗攻击。该漏洞影响所有运行 Netscape Communicator 4.73 及更早版本的系统和用户。","severity":"MEDIUM","score":5.0,"aliases":["CVE-2000-0517"],"sources":["avd"],"published":"2000-05-26T04:00:00Z","updated":"2026-06-16T21:51:54Z","remediation":"建议立即升级至 Netscape 4.74 或更高版本，该版本修复了证书站点绑定校验缺失的问题。在无法升级的旧系统中，可禁用 JavaScript 和 ActiveX 控件以降低攻击面，并严格管控 DNS 解析环境（如使用 DNSSEC）防止 DNS 劫持。鉴于 Netscape 已停止维护，建议迁移至 Firefox、Chrome 等现代浏览器以确保获得持续安全更新。","status":"completed","collected_at":"2026-07-26T00:00:00Z","references":["http://www.cert.org/advisories/CA-2000-08.html","http://www.securityfocus.com/bid/1260","https://exchange.xforce.ibmcloud.com/vulnerabilities/4550","https://github.com/CVEProject/cvelistV5/blob/3619c6454232bc86bc1c5ee6d49baecbff394f3b/cves/2000/0xxx/CVE-2000-0517.json","https://github.com/LiuCan01/cve-list-pro/blob/78b55511cee3604c22d518e32822f0435d0cacc0/cve-list/CVE-2000/CVE-2000-0517","https://github.com/HORKimhab/poc-cve-collection/blob/581b673c344d829d047fea0ed051c916f949df9f/2000/0xxx/CVE-2000-0517.md","https://github.com/Patrowl/PatrowlHearsData/blob/f8615defb985bab445eb5487b411802098cc3657/CVE/data/2000/CVE-2000-0517.json","https://github.com/github/advisory-database/blob/c94c1772ba718b7f105ed32361c896b35042b2b3/advisories/unreviewed/2022/04/GHSA-h63x-8w34-4hj2/GHSA-h63x-8w34-4hj2.json","https://github.com/yarencheng/cve-devops-playground/blob/7c450063cd3f12f7aa97a070bb18c68d6bc6767e/content/CVE-2000-0517.md","https://github.com/KTZgraph/sarenka/blob/f1fb931ab722d6c096d581ed6e3c5966d799fbaa/sarenka/feeds/cwe_details/cwe_details_600_700.json","https://github.com/Team-Atlanta/aixcc-asc-atlantis/blob/785c446f980e12155935db586aa30c3b54adcc86/crs/src/crs-patch/smith/smith/lib/cwe/raw/CWE-356.txt","https://github.com/oasis-open/cti-stix-common-objects/blob/55ba7598cbd5a52577b6887871505d931d85cb61/objects/vulnerability/vulnerability--c4514b3f-b9f6-4d49-8ee8-0c571e1346ad.json","https://github.com/leego972/titanai/blob/afa5b2310463aae5781d3fd9408071bf38e79806/data/raw/corpus_D_cyber/nvd_cve_001415.txt"],"poc_urls":[],"exp_urls":[],"repo_poc_urls":[],"repo_exp_urls":[],"has_poc":false,"has_exp":false,"raw_url":"https://github.com/adysec/AVE/blob/main/vulns/2000/AVE-2000-0584.toml"},{"ave_id":"AVE-2000-0432","file_name":"2000/AVE-2000-0432.toml","cve_id":"CVE-2000-0404","title":"Microsoft Windows CIFS Computer Browser 拒绝服务漏洞","description":"Microsoft Windows 95/98/NT 4.0/2000 系统中的 CIFS Computer Browser 服务存在拒绝服务漏洞。远程攻击者无需身份认证即可向主浏览器（Master Browser）发送特制的 ResetBrowser 数据帧，导致目标系统上的浏览器服务崩溃或停止响应，造成网络资源浏览功能不可用。该漏洞攻击复杂度低，仅需通过网络发送构造的数据包即可触发，无需用户交互。Microsoft 已在 MS00-036 安全公告中发布补丁修复此漏洞。","severity":"MEDIUM","score":5.0,"aliases":["CVE-2000-0404"],"sources":["avd"],"published":"2000-05-25T04:00:00Z","updated":"2026-06-16T21:51:38Z","remediation":"安装 Microsoft 安全公告 MS00-036 对应补丁：Windows NT 4.0 下载 https://www.microsoft.com/download/details.aspx?FamilyId=8375821F-9F40-4FC1-9757-D8D056B76351，Windows 2000 下载 https://www.microsoft.com/download/details.aspx?FamilyId=4B4CB25B-66F8-4890-A762-B45447DF213E。安装后设置注册表项 RefuseReset 为 1（DWORD），路径为 HKLM\\SYSTEM\\CurrentControlSet\\Services\\MrxSmb\\Parameters，使浏览器忽略 ResetBrowser 帧。临时缓解措施：在防火墙上阻止 UDP 端口 138，防止外部攻击者发送恶意帧。","status":"completed","collected_at":"2026-07-23T00:00:00Z","references":["http://www.microsoft.com/technet/support/kb.asp?ID=262694","http://www.securityfocus.com/bid/1262","https://docs.microsoft.com/en-us/security-updates/securitybulletins/2000/ms00-036","https://github.com/CVEProject/cvelistV5/blob/7a274ec07043f54c07d0a3b5c7fc89ba5793f023/cves/2000/0xxx/CVE-2000-0404.json","https://github.com/LiuCan01/cve-list-pro/blob/78b55511cee3604c22d518e32822f0435d0cacc0/cve-list/CVE-2000/CVE-2000-0404","https://github.com/yarencheng/cve-devops-playground/blob/cbe73d6bdcced13ea57f08566d6bbf5345864f7e/content/CVE-2000-0404.md","https://github.com/Patrowl/PatrowlHearsData/blob/1decc7ade63192f9f527bfb87145d1636c01cc59/CVE/data/2000/CVE-2000-0404.json","https://github.com/rhuitl/uClinux/blob/0486e80a025dccbe4a2213715a2ab8a5063ea86b/user/nessus/nessus-plugins/scripts/smb_nt_ms00-036.nasl","https://github.com/github/advisory-database/blob/daf3a08cbe0139b666db9d48681b6efcebbecad5/advisories/unreviewed/2022/04/GHSA-jq5m-56vh-g5fr/GHSA-jq5m-56vh-g5fr.json","https://github.com/intSpLoiT/intframework/blob/eabaa799d0260aa52b735fa9769266d1ce4b64ef/modules/cve_list.txt","https://github.com/KTZgraph/sarenka/blob/f1fb931ab722d6c096d581ed6e3c5966d799fbaa/sarenka/feeds/cve_details/cve_all_details_152400_152500.json","https://github.com/nomi-sec/NVD-Database/blob/23dc120c34402aaa65883c51c1d03b3cb02c20cb/2000/CVE-2000-0404.json","https://github.com/leego972/titanai/blob/afa5b2310463aae5781d3fd9408071bf38e79806/data/raw/corpus_D_cyber/nvd_cve_001414.txt"],"poc_urls":[],"exp_urls":[],"repo_poc_urls":[],"repo_exp_urls":[],"has_poc":false,"has_exp":false,"raw_url":"https://github.com/adysec/AVE/blob/main/vulns/2000/AVE-2000-0432.toml"},{"ave_id":"AVE-2000-0431","file_name":"2000/AVE-2000-0431.toml","cve_id":"CVE-2000-0403","title":"Microsoft Windows NT 4.0 CIFS Computer Browser 拒绝服务漏洞","description":"Windows NT 4.0 的 CIFS Computer Browser 服务存在主机公告洪泛拒绝服务漏洞。远程攻击者无需身份认证即可向目标主浏览表发送大量特制的主机公告请求，导致服务资源耗尽而崩溃，无法正常响应网络浏览请求。该漏洞影响 Windows NT 4.0 系统，攻击者只需具备网络访问能力即可触发，利用难度低。","severity":"MEDIUM","score":5.0,"aliases":["CVE-2000-0403"],"sources":["avd"],"published":"2000-05-25T04:00:00Z","updated":"2026-06-16T21:51:38Z","remediation":"安装微软 MS00-036 安全更新补丁。对于 Windows NT 4.0，在注册表 `HKLM\\SYSTEM\\CurrentControlSet\\Services\\MrxSmb\\Parameters` 中新建 DWORD 值 `MaximumBrowseEntries`，设为较小值（如 1000）以限制浏览表大小。同时在防火墙层面阻断 UDP 138 端口，防止外部攻击者发送恶意 HostAnnouncement 帧。建议禁用非必要计算机的 Browser 服务。","status":"completed","collected_at":"2026-07-23T00:00:00Z","references":["http://www.microsoft.com/technet/support/kb.asp?ID=263307","http://www.securityfocus.com/bid/1261","https://docs.microsoft.com/en-us/security-updates/securitybulletins/2000/ms00-036","https://github.com/CVEProject/cvelistV5/blob/7a274ec07043f54c07d0a3b5c7fc89ba5793f023/cves/2000/0xxx/CVE-2000-0403.json","https://github.com/LiuCan01/cve-list-pro/blob/78b55511cee3604c22d518e32822f0435d0cacc0/cve-list/CVE-2000/CVE-2000-0403","https://github.com/yarencheng/cve-devops-playground/blob/cbe73d6bdcced13ea57f08566d6bbf5345864f7e/content/CVE-2000-0403.md","https://github.com/Patrowl/PatrowlHearsData/blob/1decc7ade63192f9f527bfb87145d1636c01cc59/CVE/data/2000/CVE-2000-0403.json","https://github.com/github/advisory-database/blob/daf3a08cbe0139b666db9d48681b6efcebbecad5/advisories/unreviewed/2022/04/GHSA-mq7q-m7gg-x8gh/GHSA-mq7q-m7gg-x8gh.json","https://github.com/intSpLoiT/intframework/blob/eabaa799d0260aa52b735fa9769266d1ce4b64ef/modules/cve_list.txt","https://github.com/olbat/nvdcve/blob/5b92f5917a4a825187ccaac594f43456a77ea8f3/nvdcve/CVE-2000-0403.json","https://github.com/KTZgraph/sarenka/blob/f1fb931ab722d6c096d581ed6e3c5966d799fbaa/sarenka/feeds/cve_details/cve_all_details_152400_152500.json","https://github.com/nomi-sec/CVE-Easy-List/blob/8b2b9a8673bea39f5c895cdb2f43d026330c1de0/2000.tsv","https://github.com/hungryfoolou/Vulnerability_Mining/blob/3df1d8ed0489ae1228f975ae1f58a690aae53886/craw/cveid_craw/cveid_craw/data/cveid_by_kind/cveid_dos.txt"],"poc_urls":[],"exp_urls":[],"repo_poc_urls":[],"repo_exp_urls":[],"has_poc":false,"has_exp":false,"raw_url":"https://github.com/adysec/AVE/blob/main/vulns/2000/AVE-2000-0431.toml"},{"ave_id":"AVE-2000-1009","file_name":"2000/AVE-2000-1009.toml","cve_id":"CVE-2000-0398","title":"Rockliffe MailSite Management Agent 缓冲区溢出远程代码执行漏洞","description":"Rockliffe MailSite Management Agent 的 wconsole.dll 组件存在缓冲区溢出漏洞，远程攻击者可通过向目标系统发送特制的 HTTP GET 请求，在 query_string 参数中传入超长字符串触发缓冲区溢出，从而在受影响系统上执行任意命令。该漏洞影响 Rockliffe MailSite 邮件服务器管理组件，CVSS 评分 10.0，危害等级严重。攻击者无需身份认证即可远程利用，可能导致服务器完全被控。","severity":"CRITICAL","score":10.0,"aliases":["CVE-2000-0398"],"sources":["avd"],"published":"2000-05-24T04:00:00Z","updated":"2026-06-16T21:51:37Z","remediation":"立即升级 Rockliffe MailSite 至最新受支持版本，或联系厂商获取针对 wconsole.dll 缓冲区溢出漏洞的安全补丁。如产品已停止维护，建议迁移至仍在安全更新周期内的替代邮件服务器软件，并在防火墙规则中限制对 Management Agent 端口（默认 32000/tcp）的访问来源，仅允许受信任管理 IP 连接。","status":"completed","collected_at":"2026-07-23T00:00:00Z","references":["http://archives.neohapsis.com/archives/bugtraq/2000-05/0286.html","http://www.securityfocus.com/bid/1244","https://github.com/CVEProject/cvelistV5/blob/7a274ec07043f54c07d0a3b5c7fc89ba5793f023/cves/2000/0xxx/CVE-2000-0398.json","https://github.com/LiuCan01/cve-list-pro/blob/78b55511cee3604c22d518e32822f0435d0cacc0/cve-list/CVE-2000/CVE-2000-0398","https://github.com/fankh/vulnerability-poc/blob/ffa50060b7ba6ae58d60d6d90533e77eaf10d466/2000/CVE-2000-0398/README.md","https://github.com/yarencheng/cve-devops-playground/blob/cbe73d6bdcced13ea57f08566d6bbf5345864f7e/content/CVE-2000-0398.md","https://github.com/Patrowl/PatrowlHearsData/blob/1decc7ade63192f9f527bfb87145d1636c01cc59/CVE/data/2000/CVE-2000-0398.json","https://github.com/github/advisory-database/blob/7007cbf91cfd56bead27c222fc520c733ed0ad71/advisories/unreviewed/2022/04/GHSA-frm5-658v-2f23/GHSA-frm5-658v-2f23.json","https://github.com/blackhook/nessus-plugins/blob/64177d96abbb07c58cf7e131046b067ebc61fcb5/R/rockliffe_mailsite_overflow.nasl","https://github.com/olbat/nvdcve/blob/5b92f5917a4a825187ccaac594f43456a77ea8f3/nvdcve/CVE-2000-0398.json","https://github.com/KTZgraph/sarenka/blob/f1fb931ab722d6c096d581ed6e3c5966d799fbaa/sarenka/feeds/cve_details/cve_all_details_152400_152500.json","https://github.com/leego972/titanai/blob/afa5b2310463aae5781d3fd9408071bf38e79806/data/raw/corpus_D_cyber/nvd_cve_001404.txt"],"poc_urls":[],"exp_urls":[],"repo_poc_urls":["https://raw.githubusercontent.com/adysec/AVE/main/pocs/2000/POC-AVE-2000-1009.toml"],"repo_exp_urls":["https://raw.githubusercontent.com/adysec/AVE/main/exploits/2000/EXP-AVE-2000-1009.toml"],"has_poc":true,"has_exp":true,"raw_url":"https://github.com/adysec/AVE/blob/main/vulns/2000/AVE-2000-1009.toml"},{"ave_id":"AVE-2000-0487","file_name":"2000/AVE-2000-0487.toml","cve_id":"CVE-2000-0445","title":"PGP 5.x 自动密钥生成程序随机性不足漏洞","description":"PGP 5.x在Unix系统上的pgpk命令在非交互式密钥对生成时使用熵源不足，导致生成的密钥对具有可预测性。该漏洞影响PGP 5.x版本在Unix系统上的所有安装。攻击者需具备本地访问权限，无需认证即可利用熵源不足预测生成的私钥，进而解密通信或伪造签名，CVSS评分2.1（本地攻击/低复杂度/部分机密性影响）。","severity":"LOW","score":2.1,"aliases":["CVE-2000-0445"],"sources":["avd"],"published":"2000-05-24T04:00:00Z","updated":"2026-06-16T21:51:44Z","remediation":"建议立即升级到 PGP 6.0 或更高版本（如 GnuPG 1.0+），这些版本修复了随机数生成器使用不充分熵源的问题。若无法立即升级，请务必使用交互模式（交互式敲击键盘/移动鼠标收集熵）生成密钥对，严禁在脚本/脚本化脚本中使用非交互模式生成密钥。同时建议撤销并重新生成所有非交互模式下生成的密钥对，并更新对应的公钥分发渠道。若必须继续使用 PGP 5.x，请在生成密钥前手动向 /dev/random 写入额外熵数据（如 `dd if=/dev/random of=/dev/random bs=1k count=1`），并确保系统熵池充足（`cat /proc/sys/kernel/random/entropy_avail` 应大于 1000）。","status":"completed","collected_at":"2026-07-23T00:00:00Z","references":["http://archives.neohapsis.com/archives/bugtraq/2000-05/0273.html","http://www.cert.org/advisories/CA-2000-09.html","http://www.osvdb.org/1355","http://www.securityfocus.com/bid/1251","https://github.com/CVEProject/cvelistV5/blob/20ad1fe1013ca96ea2384f289b4316baeb76e2fc/cves/2000/0xxx/CVE-2000-0445.json","https://github.com/LiuCan01/cve-list-pro/blob/78b55511cee3604c22d518e32822f0435d0cacc0/cve-list/CVE-2000/CVE-2000-0445","https://github.com/HORKimhab/poc-cve-collection/blob/f7d503345a02e01eaaf915c0e3939c46f947a88c/2000/0xxx/CVE-2000-0445.md","https://github.com/Patrowl/PatrowlHearsData/blob/88dff62b57cbb639f2b0714fb489ef14e49d5b06/CVE/data/2000/CVE-2000-0445.json","https://github.com/github/advisory-database/blob/d1d7ac405f2460acf0b0e8ed2a5cf8c748023246/advisories/unreviewed/2022/04/GHSA-r4m8-4q3x-xfcc/GHSA-r4m8-4q3x-xfcc.json","https://github.com/yarencheng/cve-devops-playground/blob/4731f60845c8f35e2bdb03d333a9e9d84c7b1c27/content/CVE-2000-0445.md","https://github.com/nomi-sec/NVD-Database/blob/23dc120c34402aaa65883c51c1d03b3cb02c20cb/2000/CVE-2000-0445.json","https://github.com/KTZgraph/sarenka/blob/f1fb931ab722d6c096d581ed6e3c5966d799fbaa/sarenka/feeds/cve_details/cve_all_details_152400_152500.json","https://github.com/oasis-open/cti-stix-common-objects/blob/55ba7598cbd5a52577b6887871505d931d85cb61/objects/vulnerability/vulnerability--3cce52ad-5abc-4810-bafd-8d15b65fd228.json","https://github.com/nomi-sec/CVE-Easy-List/blob/11b42ffe1cb6b893f6637eddd9119ba35a8b2afe/2000.tsv"],"poc_urls":[],"exp_urls":[],"repo_poc_urls":[],"repo_exp_urls":[],"has_poc":false,"has_exp":false,"raw_url":"https://github.com/adysec/AVE/blob/main/vulns/2000/AVE-2000-0487.toml"}]